        "@value": "Romeo and Juliet | Stratford Festival Play"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Falling headlong in love, two teenagers defy the long-simmering hatred between their families. But daring to love one’s enemy comes with a terrible cost, as the needless sacrifice of young lives brings this heartbreaking story to its tragic conclusion."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
