        "@value": "HMS Pinafore | Stratford Festival Official Site"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "With witty dialogue, endearing characters, memorable tunes and a hilariously happy ending, these are the silliest shenanigans ever seen aboard a ship! Since its première in 1878, Gilbert and Sullivan’s wildly popular operetta has delighted audiences with its nautical tale of love across class divides."
      }
    ],
