        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Madwoman of Chaillot | Stratford Festival Official Site"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If oil were found beneath the streets of Paris, how would civilization fare against the demands of corporate greed? The answer lies with the flamboyantly determined woman whose quirky spirit informs this classic 20th-century comedy, as scathing as it is timely."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#site_name": [
