        "@value": "Julius Caesar | Stratford Festival Shakespeare"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "To prevent a potential tyrant from gaining control of the state, men of honour are willing to stain their hands with blood. But no one can foresee the twists of fate that follow the last twist of the knife, and the assassins' actions soon plunge their world into war."
      }
    ],
