        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paradise Lost | Stratford Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inspired by John Milton's epic poem of the cosmic battle between good and evil, Satan's revenge and the expulsion of Adam and Eve from the Garden of Eden, this ultra-contemporary new drama is fiercely engaging, irreverently funny and deeply moving."
      }
    ],
